{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "5e72a01ddc2692216e4cb60f8b8c9071d7509f39df819c8c905a0eb2be66e5f6", "ja": "宣伝、よろしく！", "zh": "宣传就拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b76aa1e7b0cff1bfcf812a85cb53ab6bd7889ad08dabf62204b837bb0865c6c1", "ja": "公演の宣伝のため、ツアーご当地のWEB\n番組に出演するメンバー達。普段は仲良しだ\nけど、本番では熱くぶつかりあう姿も見せた\nい、と意気込むが、最後の最後でジュリアが\n噛んでしまう。", "zh": "为了宣传公演，成员们参加了巡演当地的WEB\n节目。她们平时关系很好，但也想在节目中展现\n彼此热烈交锋的一面，正干劲十足地做着准备，\n没想到最后关头，茱莉亚却说错了话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b306a9c21f2e4ec911925dfb5a3a3048c3b765f7bf4918b512dcb745c95e82e3", "ja": "（ツアーの成否は、ご当地での認知度にかかっている！\n……ということで、宣伝にやってきた）", "zh": "（巡演能否成功，取决于在当地的知名度！……所以，我们来这里宣传了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "703a9df6b4e182c22f3fdcfcb821526200bf4a7faad4a1ccd7c9cbfae6615cc5", "ja": "（観光名所を紹介するWEB番組に、\nゲスト出演中だ。みんな、よろしく頼むぞ！）", "zh": "（正在介绍观光名胜的网络节目中作为嘉宾出演。大家，就拜托你们了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1002_dj", "source_sha256": "6043786feeb056b4bf5fa98f48c0ed0c63b269bb5ad594e07ddf178d6e5b92c8", "ja": "……というわけで、今日は765プロのみなさんと\n一緒にお届けしております！", "zh": "……事情就是这样，今天我们正在和\n765事务所的各位一起为大家带来节目！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "fde4d0bebea46cb097036a7d32c082d73ab76bf4b62da6774a58ddf34bc89649", "ja": "はーいっ、ご紹介ありがとうございます♪\n最近は資格取得にハマってます、秋月律子です。", "zh": "好——！谢谢你的介绍♪\n最近迷上考证了，我是秋月律子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "ab6a7c321aae01ed5062a0cb2a75f49436d8554d98b6e03a6153571a20b723b3", "ja": "うっうー！　リスナーのみなさん、こんにちは！\n元気いっぱい、高槻やよいでーす！", "zh": "呜呜——！各位听众，大家好！\n我是活力满满的高槻弥生——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "6b922307fd18cd820d28a79454da6eccbdbc4015c4c92d6f00d8eeb7f0822eb3", "ja": "高坂海美です！　特技はバレエだよ♪\n見て見て、うみみん☆ポージング！", "zh": "我是高坂海美！特长是芭蕾哦♪ 看，看这个，海美美☆摆造型！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1006_dj", "source_sha256": "8047ac93a2f5b7e430a557d82a456264a5ad6c4d1ecfa1ebdbc78086e91e39b8", "ja": "う、うわっ！？　どうなって……！？", "zh": "哇、哇啊！？　怎么回事……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "cf2535fda0d538682cdbea59b6a5e0dfe6b280560709c37f69950f37d3c02a3c", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと海美、そのポーズはダメ……！\nカメラ、ジュリアに振ってください！", "zh": "等、等一下，海美，那个姿势不行……！\n镜头请转向茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "d7ede3306d4d292545748eba19b2ccb1ca0878a7cbaff43d15a102724073babe", "ja": "お、おう！　ロックアイドルのジュリアだ。\nみんな、今日はウチらのこと、覚えていってくれよな。", "zh": "哦、哦！我是摇滚偶像茱莉亚。\n大家，今天可要记住我们哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1009_dj", "source_sha256": "020fafdc7ed2004b36f8fd05bb771f9cb4fc5f29145fc45a7c2bcf6facc3c19a", "ja": "いやー、みなさん人気アイドルという事でね。\nこっちも緊張してますけども……。", "zh": "哎呀，毕竟大家都是人气偶像嘛。\n我这边也很紧张就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "e37096f7512d80e5994aadc640494d0c27f32b8a225cbba36d32ce67ec9a6a55", "ja": "えへへっ、人気アイドルなんて、照れちゃいます……。\n私もドキドキしちゃってますよ～！", "zh": "嘿嘿，人气偶像什么的，真让人不好意思……  \n我也紧张得心怦怦跳呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "488b8829fee40918469260db4a6826df1a32239cfc946b3037ffa6cbcb8a6dfe", "ja": "そうそう。ウチらの方が、\n胸を借りるつもりっていうか……ま、気楽にいこうぜ♪", "zh": "对对。该说是我们才想向你们请教吧……总之，放轻松点吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1012_dj", "source_sha256": "c130206fdab9ff98469550215d4049ee236303be2daf551d3c745335608f5204", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nじゃあ早速、ツアーの話をしていただきましょう。", "zh": "谢谢！\n那么现在就请您来说说巡演的事情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1013_dj", "source_sha256": "bf3f898ca3ab5415763362897e95cfb8a69867711eba91f08c711f7776744496", "ja": "今回の『ShineLight』公演、\nズバリ、見どころは？", "zh": "这次的《ShineLight》公演，亮点究竟是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "77f1d201c0fe3efd3576742ab0e50c39b8fd3aae691822d643b17d1395de9383", "ja": "はい、「キラキラより、ギラギラ！」です！\nバチバチーって感じですよ。", "zh": "没错，就是“比闪闪发光更耀眼夺目”！\n是一种火花四溅的感觉哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "33fde55759cc9071c04244af41d24022622efedb23e194b3ece71a7ed20d5599", "ja": "普段は私達、仲良しですけど……それだけじゃなくて、\n熱くぶつかりあうところも見せたいですね。", "zh": "平时我们虽然关系很好，但不只是这样……\n也想展现出我们激烈碰撞的一面呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "2c71a07ad3f0a9f3086874a020a0858438d61470b8b5bd93578997c787f755c1", "ja": "うんうん！　仲良しだからこそ、\n本気でぶつかり合うことができるって！", "zh": "嗯嗯！正因为关系好，才能真正全力碰撞嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1017_dj", "source_sha256": "fa7533eef6ac299e96432841ab407e3a63ae73a6acf7e1fc2e6a5680aa71e45e", "ja": "なるほど！　それは、\n見ごたえのありそうなステージになりそうですね。", "zh": "原来如此！那看来会是，\n一场很有看头的演出呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "f05d0edccaa6af038d096015dd47b99f3daa65abfea46dd8296177c2996d7a47", "ja": "ああ。絶対に後悔させないぜ。だから、\n是非観に来てくりゅ……", "zh": "啊。我绝对不会让你后悔的。所以，请一定要来看哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "e6cd1cecf96ed82e9352bb6ec142c670d88809d61dbb4cf98f1e380b17829af4", "ja": "観に来てくれよなっ！", "zh": "你可一定要来看啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "c970c1a496ae36383fbf131a6a046d847a9ded9bd95ab48b1a994d997381dab6", "ja": "わわっ、ジュリア、今噛んだ！？　珍しいっ！", "zh": "哇哇，茱莉亚，刚才咬到舌头了！？真少见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "80ac94e06c4c8114b705d175f2770f0bf0620db004f4e9adffcac4a0a016c6ae", "ja": "う、うるさい！　イジるなっての！\nくっ、肝心なとこで……本番で絶対、挽回するからな！", "zh": "吵、吵死了！别拿我开涮啦！\n可恶，居然在关键时刻……正式演出时我绝对会挽回局面的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1022_dj", "source_sha256": "44d8f5408a9ffd6bd688880094493eade3288c497732f34bdead670f0b115aef", "ja": "あはは！　本当に緊張してたんですね。\nこっちも気が楽になりましたよ。", "zh": "啊哈哈！看来您真的很紧张呢。\n我也跟着放松下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_03_1023_p", "source_sha256": "bff2c01db2d6c45515a6687620c3c01e3902ffb06eb14af734868c201e33ec28", "ja": "（よしっ、撮れ高、撮れ高！）", "zh": "（好，素材，素材！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
